OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785255527
OL,3,CTrump and Netanyahu to discuss Iran
OL,4,Cwar in first meeting since conflict
OL,5,Cbegan
OL,7,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,8,FNetanyahu will attend face-to-face
OL,9,Ftalks with US President Donald Trump
OL,10,Fat the White House on Tuesday, in what
OL,11,Fwill be the first time the pair have
OL,12,Fmet since declaring war on Iran.
OL,14,FThe meeting in Washington is seen by
OL,15,Fboth leaders as a chance to put on a
OL,16,Funited front to the world amid rumours
OL,17,Fof strains in their relationship.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
