OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785255527
OL,3,CTrump and Netanyahu to discuss Iran
OL,4,Cwar in first meeting since conflict
OL,5,Cbegan
OL,7,FIt will also be the first in-person
OL,8,Ftalks since the war began with US-
OL,9,FIsraeli strikes on Iran in late
OL,10,FFebruary.
OL,12,FBefore setting off on Monday,
OL,13,FNetanyahu told reporters in Israel
OL,14,Fthat this would be his eighth meeting
OL,15,Fwith President Trump since he was re-
OL,16,Felected in 2025 - but his first since
OL,17,Fthe conflict in Iran broke out.
OL,19,F"This is a great privilege, but it is
OL,20,Falso a great responsibility," he said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785255527
OL,3,CTrump and Netanyahu to discuss Iran
OL,4,Cwar in first meeting since conflict
OL,5,Cbegan
OL,7,F"We will discuss all the issues on the
OL,8,Fagenda, first and foremost Iran.
OL,9,FNaturally, our goal is to safeguard
OL,10,Four security and also to expand the
OL,11,Fcircle of peace around us," he added.
OL,13,FThe talks come at a time when both
OL,14,Fleaders face growing pressures at home.
OL,16,FNetanyahu is up for reelection and is
OL,17,Fembattled in part because of his
OL,18,Fdeteriorating relationship with Trump.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785255527
OL,3,CTrump and Netanyahu to discuss Iran
OL,4,Cwar in first meeting since conflict
OL,5,Cbegan
OL,7,FTrump is under pressure to end an
OL,8,Funpopular war that has wreaked
OL,9,Feconomic havoc and driven prices
OL,10,Fhigher ahead of midterm elections this
OL,11,FNovember.
OL,13,FRelations between the pair have blown
OL,14,Fhot and cold in recent times.
OL,16,FWhen asked by reporters if he and the
OL,17,FIsraeli prime minister were on the
OL,18,Fsame page with Iran, Trump replied:
OL,19,F"We have a little difference," before
OL,20,Fadding: "But pretty close, yeah."
OL,26,@{D@AOU|D@IOU|D@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785255527
OL,3,CTrump and Netanyahu to discuss Iran
OL,4,Cwar in first meeting since conflict
OL,5,Cbegan
OL,7,FNaturally, the Iran war is likely to
OL,8,Fdominate much of Tuesday's
OL,9,Fdiscussions, but the two leaders also
OL,10,Fplan to discuss the framework
OL,11,Fagreement the US and Israel signed
OL,12,Fwith Lebanon over the Israel-Hezbollah
OL,13,Fwar and the expansion of the Abraham
OL,14,FAccords, a White House official
OL,15,Fconfirmed.
OL,17,FTrump is also set to welcome Ukrainian
OL,18,FPresident Volodymyr Zelenskyy to the
OL,19,FWhite House on Tuesday to discuss the
OL,20,Fother war in Ukraine.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
