OL,3,CTrump and Netanyahu to discuss Iran
OL,4,Cwar in first meeting since conflict
OL,5,Cbegan
OL,7,FThe leader is travelling to Washington
OL,8,Ffor the funeral of Senator Lindsey
OL,9,FGraham, whose final act as a public
OL,10,Fofficial was visiting Kyiv and
OL,11,Fsecuring an agreement on a package of
OL,12,Fsanctions that seek to punish
OL,13,Fcountries that purchase Russian oil,
OL,14,Fgas and other exports.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
